 "title": "Relative tangent bundle",
 "statement": "For a smooth morphism $f:X\\to Y$, the relative tangent bundle is $T_{X/Y}:=\\operatorname{Spec}_X\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\mathcal O_X}(\\Omega_{X/Y})\\to X$, whose zero section corresponds to the augmentation $\\operatorname{Sym}(\\Omega_{X/Y})\\to\\mathcal O_X$.",
